WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.578
I see monkeys.

2
00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:18.136
There are balloons.

3
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:26.539
I see snakes.

4
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:34.814
There is a polar bear.

5
00:00:34.815 --> 00:00:43.116
I see a tall giraffe.

6
00:00:43.117 --> 00:00:51.444
There are tigers.

7
00:00:51.445 --> 00:00:59.269
I see hungry seals.

8
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:06.631
Where am I?

9
00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:14.264
I am at the zoo.

